{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40770","headline":"马嵬感事 · 唐求","name":"马嵬感事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冷气生深殿，狼星渡远关。\n九城鼙鼓内，千骑道途间。\n凤髻随秋草，銮舆入暮山。\n恨多留不得，悲泪满龙颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐求","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}